@title Wiring guide: click the Shape switch to change between Corners and Lines (1920x1080)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1920x1080
# The strip at the bottom of the drawing ends in a framed switch that names the current wire shape and the other one;
# clicking it switches without starting or ending a wire (nothing is drawn).
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key w
wait 3
move 800 450
wait 3
shot shape-corners
expect_scene "wire"
move 1402 1032
wait_s 2
shot shape-tooltip
expect "right-angle corners"
click 1402 1032
wait 5
move 800 450
wait 3
shot shape-lines
click 1402 1032
wait 5
move 800 450
wait 3
shot shape-corners-again
